{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "%lld days": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 日"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "0 — No spoilers": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "0 — ネタバレなし"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 day": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 日"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 — Up to where I am": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 — 見ているところまで"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2 — Light": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2 — 軽め"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "3 — Unrestricted": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "3 — 制限なし"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "API key saved in Keychain": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API キーはキーチェーンに保存済み"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "API keys, private keys, tokens, card numbers and passwords are detected on-device. Their values are never stored or shown. Text containing them is never translated or archived.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API キー・秘密鍵・トークン・カード番号・パスワードを端末内で検出します。値そのものは保存も表示もしません。それらを含むテキストは翻訳も記録もしません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "APPLE INTELLIGENCE AVAILABLE": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "APPLE INTELLIGENCE 利用可能"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "追加"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adds a one-line note about what the text means for you. Runs entirely on this Mac.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "その内容があなたにとって何を意味するかを 1 行で添えます。すべてこの Mac 上で動きます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After enabling the app in System Settings, quit and reopen it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "システム設定でこのアプリをオンにしたら、一度終了して開き直してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ambient Screen Intelligence watches your screen with you and quietly adds what you would have searched for — a translation, a term, the cause of an error, who is on screen.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ambient Screen Intelligence はあなたと一緒に画面を見て、調べようとしていたこと — 翻訳、用語、エラーの原因、画面に映っている人 — をそっと補足します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ambient Screen Intelligence: %@. %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ambient Screen Intelligence: %@。%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Analysis": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "解析"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Intelligence": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Intelligence"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Archive intel shown in the HUD": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HUD に表示した情報を記録する"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Archived: text shown in the HUD, and — if enabled — titles, URLs (without query strings) and reading time of pages, for automatic bookmarks and work sessions. Never screenshots. On this Mac only; excluded apps are never recorded. Search with ⌥⌘K. macOS asks once per browser before URLs can be read.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "記録するのは HUD に表示したテキストと、（オンの場合）自動ブックマークと作業セッションのためのページのタイトル・URL（クエリ文字列なし）・閲覧時間です。スクリーンショットは保存しません。この Mac の中だけに保存し、除外アプリは記録しません。⌥⌘K で検索できます。URL を読む前に、ブラウザごとに一度 macOS が確認します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Archive…": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "アーカイブ…"
          }
