        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "開発者向け"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Draws changed regions, OCR areas, router scores, counters and timings on screen. Never shows recognized text.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "変化領域・OCR 範囲・ルーターのスコア・件数・処理時間を画面に描きます。認識したテキストは表示しません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Error: %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "エラー: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything else works without it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "それ以外の機能は Apple Intelligence なしで使えます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Excluded apps": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "除外アプリ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Excluded apps are removed from the captured image and never analyzed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "除外アプリはキャプチャ画像から取り除かれ、解析されません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Explain technical terms and judge borderline text": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "専門用語の解説と、迷う候補の判定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Follow the display under the mouse pointer": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "マウスポインタのあるディスプレイを追う"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GEMINI ENABLED": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GEMINI 有効"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gemini API key": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gemini API キー"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Grant Screen Recording Permission…": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "画面収録を許可…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HUD": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HUD"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hover a card to keep it and to open its actions. ⌥⌘K opens the archive of everything it has shown you.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "カードにポインタを乗せると表示が続き、操作ボタンが使えます。⌥⌘K でこれまでに表示した内容のアーカイブを開けます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hovering the HUD keeps it on screen and tells the app the information was useful. Use “Not Useful” in the menu bar to see less of something.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HUD にポインタを乗せると表示が続き、役に立ったことがアプリに伝わります。表示を減らしたいものは、メニューバーの「役に立たなかった」を使ってください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I read English — don't translate it": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "英語は読めるので翻訳しない"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Identify public figures named on screen": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "画面に名前が出ている著名人を識別する"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Intelligence": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "インテリジェンス"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It is off until you enable it and save your API key. Only cropped image regions, names, window titles or headlines are sent — never the whole screen, never faces, never text with secrets.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "オンにして API キーを保存するまでは使いません。送るのは切り抜いた画像の一部・名前・ウィンドウタイトル・見出しだけで、画面全体・顔・秘密情報を含むテキストは送りません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It prefers to show nothing. Most of the time you will not notice it; a card appears only when it is likely to be worth it, and fades after a few seconds.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "基本は何も表示しません。ほとんどの時間は存在に気づかないはずです。役に立ちそうなときだけカードが現れ、数秒で消えます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep for": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存期間"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Last: %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "直前: %@"
