    "Screen Recording permission is required to start.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "開始するには画面収録の許可が必要です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Screen Recording permission required": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "画面収録の許可が必要です"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Screen access": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "画面へのアクセス"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Screen content is processed in memory on this Mac. Screen images are never saved. Nothing is sent over the network unless you turn on Cloud identification.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "画面の内容はこの Mac のメモリ上で処理します。画面画像は保存しません。クラウド識別をオンにしない限り、ネットワークには何も送りません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Screen sharing": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "画面共有"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Settings…": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "設定…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Spoilers": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ネタバレ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "開始"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Starting…": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "起動中…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop Translating %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ を翻訳しない"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stopped": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "停止中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To see what you see, the app needs Screen Recording permission. Frames stay in memory and are never saved or uploaded.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "あなたと同じ画面を見るために、画面収録の許可が必要です。フレームはメモリ上だけで扱い、保存もアップロードもしません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Top right corner": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "右上"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Translate into": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "翻訳先"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Translation": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "翻訳"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Translation Languages…": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "翻訳言語…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Translation runs on this Mac with Apple's Translation models. Download the languages you want translated in System Settings › General › Language & Region › Translation Languages.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "翻訳は Apple の翻訳モデルを使ってこの Mac 上で行います。翻訳したい言語を「システム設定 › 一般 › 言語と地域 › 翻訳言語」でダウンロードしてください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Translation runs on-device. Install language models in System Settings › General › Language & Region › Translation Languages.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "翻訳はこの Mac 上で行います。言語モデルは「システム設定 › 一般 › 言語と地域 › 翻訳言語」でダウンロードしてください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Google Gemini to identify animals, plants, landmarks and public figures": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Google Gemini で動植物・ランドマーク・著名人を識別する"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Visual memory": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ビジュアルメモリ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Warn about secrets while sharing the screen": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "画面共有中に秘密情報を警告する"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Welcome Guide…": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ようこそガイド…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With Apple Intelligence (macOS 26), the app also explains technical terms, errors and code, adds one-line briefings, names your work sessions and filters borderline cards — all on-device.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Intelligence（macOS 26）があれば、専門用語・エラー・コードの解説、ひとことメモ、作業セッションの命名、迷うカードの判定も行います。すべて端末内で動きます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Work cards and news backgrounds use Gemini (window title or headline only). Without it, News mode shows related pages you read earlier. Both need “Remember pages you read”. “Up to where I am” uses the episode number in the title; without one it behaves like “No spoilers”.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "作品カードとニュースの背景には Gemini を使います（送るのはウィンドウタイトルか見出しだけ）。Gemini がない場合、ニュースモードは以前に読んだ関連ページを表示します。どちらも「読んだページを記録する」が必要です。「見ているところまで」はタイトルの話数を使い、話数がなければ「ネタバレなし」と同じ動作になります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• Only what a card showed, plus page titles and URLs (if enabled), is archived — on this Mac, excluded from backups, deletable at any time.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• 記録するのはカードに表示した内容と、（オンの場合）ページのタイトルと URL だけです。この Mac の中に保存し、バックアップから除外され、いつでも消去できます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• Password managers, Messages and Photos are excluded; you can add more apps.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• パスワード管理アプリ・メッセージ・写真は除外済みです。除外するアプリは追加できます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• Pause any time from the menu bar, for 5 minutes, 30 minutes or until tomorrow.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• メニューバーからいつでも一時停止できます（5 分・30 分・明日まで）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• Screen images are never written to disk.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• 画面画像はディスクに保存しません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "◢ FIELD MANUAL": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "◢ FIELD MANUAL"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
